-- The consolidation's words of section 7, taken from the src:51 line above (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY). It differs from the literal replay by the comma and the space around the inserted characters; the row types both and gives no reason.
`the consolidation's words of section 7` MEANS "פרסום לשון הרע לאדם אחד או יותר זולת הנפגע תהא עוולה אזרחית, ובכפוף להוראות חוק זה יחולו עליה הוראות הסעיפים 2(2) עד 15, 55ב, 58 עד 61 ו־63 עד 68א לפקודת הנזיקים האזרחיים, 1944."

-- The numbers section 7 names, as tokens, after the 1967 insertion. The row types them and tests none of them against the Ordinance.
`the numbers section 7 names after the 1967 insertion` MEANS LIST "2(2)", "15", "55ב", "58", "61", "63", "68א"

-- The New Version: its title, its star footnote, and section 93.
-- ext:[nv10-p266] | * ע״ר 1944, תוס׳ 1 מס׳ 1380, עמ׳ 93; ס״ח, תשי״ב, עמ׳ 340; תשט״ז, עמ׳ 51; תשט״ז, עמ׳ 78; תשי״ח, עמ׳ 114; תש״ך, עמ׳ 46; תשכ״ג, עמ׳ 76; תשכ״ה, עמ׳ 244, 245.
`the title of the New Version as printed` MEANS
    `A printed text` WITH
        `the instrument that printed it` IS `the New Version`
        `the printed page it is on` IS 266
        `its words` IS "פקודת הנזיקין [נוסח חדש]"

`the star footnote of the New Version, printed page 266` MEANS
    `A printed text` WITH
        `the instrument that printed it` IS `the New Version`
        `the printed page it is on` IS 266
        `its words` IS "ע״ר 1944, תוס׳ 1 מס׳ 1380, עמ׳ 93; ס״ח, תשי״ב, עמ׳ 340; תשט״ז, עמ׳ 51; תשט״ז, עמ׳ 78; תשי״ח, עמ׳ 114; תש״ך, עמ׳ 46; תשכ״ג, עמ׳ 76; תשכ״ה, עמ׳ 244, 245."

-- Section 93, printed page 278. The footer of that page is cut by the edge of the page, so the printed number is by the count (NOTES.md section 3).
-- The Hebrew date of the section was converted with the Hebrew-calendar routine after its control: 9 Tishri 5729 is 1968-10-01.
-- ext:[nv10-p278] | תחילה
-- ext:[nv10-p278] | 93. תחילתו של נוסח חדש זה היא ביום ט׳ בתשרי תשכ״ט (1 באוקטובר 1968)
`section 93 of the New Version as printed` MEANS
    `A printed text` WITH
        `the instrument that printed it` IS `the New Version`
        `the printed page it is on` IS 278
        `its words` IS "תחילתו של נוסח חדש זה היא ביום ט׳ בתשרי תשכ״ט (1 באוקטובר 1968)"

`the commencement of the New Version as section 93 prints it` MEANS
    `A commencement as read` WITH
        `the instrument` IS `the New Version`
        `the date the page prints` IS JUST (Date 1 10 1968)
        `how it was read` IS `official page image`

-- THE COMPARISON TABLE, printed page 280, headed "לוח השוואה". Four double columns; in each, the right-hand column is headed "הסעיף הקודם" (the old section) and the left-hand column "הסעיף החדש" (the new section).
-- The row reads: old-section cell, then new-section cell, each typed in reading order (right to left) with single spaces. The page prints a long dash inside a cell; it is typed as the en dash.
-- A row typed here is a row of a band the page deposit holds (NOTES.md section 6 lists the bands). The row does not read the sections of the New Version that the new-section cells name.
-- ext:[nv10-p280] | לוח השוואה
-- ext:[nv10-p280] | הסעיף החדש | הסעיף הקודם

GIVEN oc IS A STRING, n IS A NUMBER, l IS A STRING, nc IS A STRING, p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A row of the comparison table`
`a printed row` MEANS
    `A row of the comparison table` WITH
        `the old-section cell` IS oc
        `the old section number` IS n
        `the old section letter` IS l
        `the new-section cell` IS nc
        `its place among the rows of its band` IS p

