-- ===== THE TWO ITEMS, each with its two limbs =====

`item I1` MEANS
    `An item` WITH
        `the item` IS "I1: paragraph (6) of section 13 names an Ordinance; section 30 of the Commissions of Inquiry Law prints that name with the word בטלה"
        `the citing words are in` IS "SH 464 printed page 242, paragraph (6) of section 13; after SH 508 item 7 the name is still there"
        `limb (a) holds` IS TRUE
        `limb (a) was read` IS `official page image`
        `limb (b) holds` IS TRUE
        `limb (b) was read` IS `official page image`
        `the instruments and pages read` IS "SH 548 printed pages 28 and 32; SH 464 printed pages 241 and 242; SH 508 printed page 133; SH 1494 printed page 42, SH 931 printed page 82 and SH 1115 printed page 128 (read, not deposited); NOTES.md section 7"

`item I2` MEANS
    `An item` WITH
        `the item` IS "I2: section 7 names the section numbers 55ב and 68א of the Ordinance of 1944; the comparison table of the New Version prints no row for old 68א and prints no 55ב in the new-section cells of the rows for old 55ב"
        `the citing words are in` IS "SH 464 printed page 240, section 7, and SH 508 printed page 133, item 4"
        `limb (a) holds` IS TRUE
        `limb (a) was read` IS `official page image`
        `limb (b) holds` IS TRUE
        `limb (b) was read` IS `official page image`
        `the instruments and pages read` IS "New Version of the Civil Wrongs Ordinance, printed pages 266, 278 and 280; SH 464 printed pages 240, 244 and 245; SH 508 printed page 133; NOTES.md section 7"
